    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d632">

                <pb facs="0604" n="432" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg432"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/4047</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-25T13:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 25, 1917, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received April 25, 7.20 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your April 23, 6 p.m. As the Chinese Government is on the verge of a decision, I
                    beg to request that after the passage of the bill for financial assistance I be
                    informed so as to report to you before signature by the President.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
